OL,3,GNEWSAChildren would have died if
OL,4,Agroynes were in place, RNLI chief warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to install controversial beach
OL,7,Fgroynes in Blackpool could put lives at
OL,8,Frisk, a leading RNLI figure has
OL,9,Fclaimed.
OL,11,FSteven Fitzgerald, chairman of
OL,12,FBlackpool RNLI, said two children and
OL,13,Fan adult that were rescued in May might
OL,14,Fhave died if the structures had been in
OL,15,Fplace.
OL,17,FHe said: "We probably only had five
OL,18,Fseconds before that little lad lost his
OL,19,Flife. It is the difference between life
OL,20,Fand death. This is where we're coming
OL,21,Ffrom."
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
