OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAChildren would have died if
OL,4,Agroynes were in place, RNLI chief warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Jane Hugo said Blackpool
OL,7,FCouncil, which is proposing 33 rock
OL,8,Fgroynes across two sites, said the
OL,9,Fstructures would be as far away "as
OL,10,Fpossible" from the piers to provide
OL,11,Fbetter access for RNLI vessels.
